  abilityDesc: 21 combo powerful Dark attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining
    HP), hugely boosts Atk, Def and enormously boosts critical hit rate of Dark types
    for 3 turns, boosts critical damage for 3 turns, hugely boosts Atk, Def relative
    to max HP for 3 turns, 50% damage reduction for 2 turns & enormously boosts Dark
    elemental damage for 3 turns
